  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 7.3 Sex Industry and Adult Business Premises.pdf\n\nClause None - zoning (land_use_zoning): MLEP 2011  specifically regulates where sex services premises ( IN1 General Industrial zone , IN2 Light Industrial zone and B6 Enterprise Corridor zone ) and restricted premises ( B4 Mixed Use zone and B5 Business Development zone) may be located.\n\nClause None - amenity (development_control): Council’s controls ar e designed to ensure that adult businesses, restricted premises and sex services premises operate in appropriate locations, do not result in a loss of amenity or environmental impact and are designed and operated to comply with wider industry standards, re gulations and this DCP.\n\nClause O2 - other (development_control): To minimise amenity impacts upon adjoining land uses, particularly residential and other  sensitive land uses.\n\nClause None - other (development_control): Disturbances caused by insufficient off -street parking\n\n",
